From 51a1c92948c0cb4110b93d33dba754fb3cd64741 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 10:57:16 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] API 45: damage-entities-in-box part 2 (players, shields,
 immunity) and player-state.blocking

Players whose feet are in the box are hit too, through the game's own hurt: a shield raised toward the blow's new source blocks it and wears, armour counts, the hurt player burns. Creative and spectator players are immune. Each result says the player and whether it was blocked (counted at the call from the shield raised and the facing, shield_faces). player-control's player-state gains blocking.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RYe92n7spgy8vtm4CovRWA
